  "issue": 395,
  "request": "Goal: Complete Issue 395. Implement automatic post-operation upgrade for plugin install and plugin update-all. Scope: add --no-upgrade to install and update-all; after install success run senti upgrade by default; after update-all success run senti upgrade only if at least one package reports updated true or commit changed; skip upgrade for update-all with no updates; do not trigger upgrade from plugin source update or plugin sync; JSON responses expose packages plus upgrade.ran and upgrade.ok, and show upgrade failure separately from the plugin operation result. Out of Scope: no changes to upgrade internals, no release or publish commands.",
